course: dictionary
lesson: 11052
title: Wee: small, or a toilet word
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One word can have two very different meanings, and the context tells you which one is meant. In Scotland, Ireland and Northern England, wee means small. «Wee Callum in Glasgow said he'd scored a hat-trick» is about a little boy, not a tiny goal.
explain: Wee is also an informal word for urine, or for going to the toilet to pass urine. «Blood in wee or poo needs checking by a doctor» has the clue «poo» next to it, so wee here must mean urine. The words around a word tell you which meaning to pick.
explain: Ask: which meaning fits? Try the small meaning in the sentence instead. «A wee bit» means «a small bit», which makes sense. If the small meaning does not fit, check the other meaning, and then a dictionary will confirm it.
fact: Context means the words and sentences around a word.
fact: «Wee» means small or little, as in «a wee bit» (a small amount). It is common in Scotland, Ireland and Northern England.
fact: «Wee» is an informal word for urine, and to wee means to pass urine: «go for a wee».
fact: «Braw» (Scotland) means lovely, so «wee yin» means little one.
fact: Always flush and wash your hands after you wee, to keep clean and healthy.
exercise: «Wee Callum in Glasgow said he'd scored a hat-trick.» What does wee mean here? | Very angry | Lost | Wet | *Small
exercise: «Blood in wee or poo needs checking by a doctor.» What does wee mean here? | A kind of sweet | Sunshine | Small | *Urine
exercise: «Ah, they're braw, cheers, wee yin.» What does braw mean? | Wet through | Sad | Heavy | *Lovely
test: «I need a wee» is something a small child might say at school. What does it mean? | They are cold | *They need to go to the toilet | They feel very small | They want a drink of water
test: «We waited a wee while for the bus.» What does wee while mean? | Lots of rain | A long night | *A short time | A loud noise
exam: In «Always flush and wash your hands after you wee», what does wee mean? | Be small | Run fast | Eat a snack | *Pass urine
